{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 23, "data": [{"docid2": 2264324, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260731_2264324.htm", "content": "　　在宁化县城南村，村民小聂家曾经有个“上不去”的厨房。\n　　灶台太高，肢体残疾的他得撑着边缘勉强操作；地面坑洼，腿脚不便的他端碗拿物得步步留心；线路老化，夜里不敢同时运行大功率电器。这个一户多人残疾家", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260731_2264324.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.31 08:44:00", "doctitle": "我市稳步增进残疾人民生福祉", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2478436, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260731_2264324.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2233181, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260701_2233181.htm", "content": "　　6月30日，三明市2026年“暖心护航·无碍前行”高校残疾人毕业生专场招聘会在市残疾人综合服务中心一楼大厅举办，吸引来自全市各县（市、区）的应往届未就业高校残疾人毕业生到场求职。\n　　此次活动由市人社局、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260701_2233181.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.01 08:44:00", "doctitle": "我市举办高校残疾人毕业生专场招聘会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2446085, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260701_2233181.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2195834, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260321_2195834.htm", "content": "　　连日来，市残联联合财政、人社、金融监管、人民银行等部门在全省率先开展金融助残“圆梦行动”，聚焦残疾人群体就业创业融资痛点，以全链条金融服务提升助残供给质效。\n　　“圆梦行动”针对残疾人、残疾人家庭成", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260321_2195834.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.21 10:02:00", "doctitle": "我市在全省率先开展金融助残“圆梦行动”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2405373, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260321_2195834.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2194934, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rm-VqCOC5urDNZX9mBvuHw", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rm-VqCOC5urDNZX9mBvuHw", "docreltime": "2026.03.17 10:10:00", "doctitle": "惠残政策①丨福建2026年为民办实事项目公布！两个项目与残疾人朋友息息相关！", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2404315, "sourcename": "福建省人民政府门户网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rm-VqCOC5urDNZX9mBvuHw", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2154279, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202509/t20250911_2154279.htm", "content": "\n　　县（市、区）\n　　困难残疾人生活补贴发放情况\n　　重度残疾人护理补贴发放情况\n　　总人数\n　　低保家庭中的残疾人\n　　低保标准100%-130%的重度残疾人\n　　60周岁以上无固定收入的重度残疾人\n　　月发放金额\n", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202509/t20250911_2154279.htm", "docreltime": "2025.07.01 12:15:00", "doctitle": "残疾人两项补贴发放进度表（截至2025年6月）", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2356104, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202509/t20250911_2154279.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202509/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2104285, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202503/t20250304_2104285.htm", "content": "\n　　一是智慧养老增福祉。结合家庭养老床位建设、适老化改造等项目需求，适配生命体征监测设备、轮椅、护理床、假肢矫形器等康复辅具2.1万件，运用开展康复护理 18.9万人次。二是医疗康复广应用。在141个乡（镇）卫", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202503/t20250304_2104285.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.04 09:42:00", "doctitle": "我市促进康复辅具应用多业态融合", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2297764, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202503/t20250304_2104285.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2057284, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202409/t20240903_2057284.htm", "content": "\n　　各设区市民政局、平潭综合实验区社会事业局：\n　　根据《福建省“十四五”民政事业发展专项规划》有关要求，2024年继续实施“福康工程”项目。为进一步规范项目实施，推进年度任务落实，现将有关事项通知如下：", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/rysf/fczcfw/cjrkffw/202409/t20240903_2057284.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.03 16:45:00", "doctitle": "福建省民政厅关于做好2024年“福康工程”项目实施工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2242898, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/rysf/fczcfw/cjrkffw/202409/t20240903_2057284.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "02", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/rysf/fczcfw/cjrkffw/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2028858, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/t20240527_2028858.htm", "content": "\n　　闽残联维权〔2024〕31号\n　　各市、县（区）残联、财政局，平潭综合实验区残联、财政金融局：\n　　为进一步满足残疾人需求，提高残疾人家庭无障碍改造质效，省残联、省财政厅对《福建省残疾人家庭无障碍改造补贴", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/t20240527_2028858.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.05 10:07:00", "doctitle": "福建省残疾人联合会 福建省财政厅关于修订福建省残疾人家庭无障碍改造省级补贴目录和示范户考核标准的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2204262, "sourcename": "三明市民政局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/t20240527_2028858.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "福建省残疾人家庭无障碍改造省级补贴目录（2024年修订）.doc", "appdocid": 2028858, "appfile": "P020240527368954939253.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/t20240527_2028858.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202405/P020240527/P020240527368954939253.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/P020240527368954939253.doc"}, {"appdesc": "不同类别残疾人适用的家庭无障碍改造项目目录（2024年修订）.doc", "appdocid": 2028858, "appfile": "P020240527368955049390.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/t20240527_2028858.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202405/P020240527/P020240527368955049390.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/P020240527368955049390.doc"}, {"appdesc": "残疾人家庭无障碍改造示范户考核标准（2024年修订）.doc", "appdocid": 2028858, "appfile": "P020240527368955149566.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 3, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/t20240527_2028858.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202405/P020240527/P020240527368955149566.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/P020240527368955149566.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202405/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1978314, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://mzt.fujian.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/zc/gfxwj/202311/t20231120_6304448.htm", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://mzt.fujian.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/zc/gfxwj/202311/t20231120_6304448.htm", "docreltime": "2023.11.23 15:45:00", "doctitle": "福建省民政厅 福建省财政厅 福建省残疾人联合会关于印发《福建省困难残疾人生活补贴和重度残疾人护理补贴实施办法》的通知", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2143847, "sourcename": "福建民政", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "http://mzt.fujian.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/zc/gfxwj/202311/t20231120_6304448.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1939865, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202309/t20230905_1939865.htm", "content": "\n　　各设区市民政局、平潭综合实验区社会事业局:\n　　根据《福建省“十四五”民政事业发展专项规划》有关要求，2023年继续实施“福康工程”项目。为进一步规范项目实施，推进年度任务落实，现将有关事项通知如下:\n　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202309/t20230905_1939865.htm", "docreltime": "2023.08.05 16:39:00", "doctitle": "福建省民政厅关于做好2023年“福康工程”项目实施工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2098705, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202309/t20230905_1939865.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1939838, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "残疾人福利", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cjrfl/202309/t20230905_1939838.htm", "content": "\n　　各设区市民政局、财政局、卫健委、残联，平潭综合实验区社会事业局、财政金融局、残联：\n　　现将《福建省“精康融合行动”实施方案》印发你们，请结合工作实际，认真贯彻执行。\n　　福建省民政厅             ", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/cj